[
  {
    "id": "elem_1",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "LoRA-Drop 论文复现与自适应补偿缩放改进实验报告",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_3",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "一、实验内容及文献情况介绍",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_5",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "实验内容",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_7",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "本实验复现了论文《LoRA-Drop: Efficient LoRA Parameters Dropping for Large Language Models》（arXiv:2601.02569v1）所提出的 LoRA-Drop 推理加速框架，并在原方法基础上提出了方案 A：自适应补偿缩放（Adaptive Compensation Scaling）改进，对比分析两者在推理吞吐量与训练收敛行为上的差异。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_9",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "实验基于以下环境搭建与运行：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_10",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "模型：Qwen2.5-1.5B（HuggingFace Transformers 格式）",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
