    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_23",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "二、应用背景及核心算法实现及改进",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_25",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "应用背景及核心算法介绍",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_27",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "大语言模型（LLM）自回归解码时，每生成一个 token 都需要对所有 Transformer 层进行完整的前向计算，计算代价高昂。LoRA-Drop 的核心思想是：相邻 token 的隐状态高度相似，因此可以周期性地跳过部分层，用轻量 LoRA 模块对跳过层的误差进行补偿。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_29",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "算法流程如下：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_31",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "设模型共 $L$ 层，定义两个超参数：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_32",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "$\\rho$（drop ratio）：每个 refresh 周期内可跳过的层比例",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "定义两个超参数：",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>ρ</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "（drop ratio）：每个 refresh 周期内可跳过的层比例",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_33",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "$k$（refresh period）：每隔 $k$ 个 token 做一次完整前向计算",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>k</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "（refresh period）：每隔 $k$ 个 token 做一次完整前向计算",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_35",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "在生成第 $t$ 个 token 时：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_37",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_38",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "h_l^{(t)} = \\begin{cases}",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "在生成第 $t$ 个 token 时：",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>=</m:t></m:r><m:d><m:dPr><m:begChr m:val=\"{\"/><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/><m:endChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:m><m:mPr><m:baseJc m:val=\"center\"/><m:plcHide m:val=\"on\"/><m:mcs><m:mc><m:mcPr><m:count m:val=\"2\"/><m:mcJc m:val=\"center\"/></m:mcPr></m:mc></m:mcs></m:mPr><m:mr><m:e><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>FullLayer</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l−1</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>if </m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>tmodk=0</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t> (refresh step)</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:mr><m:mr><m:e><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:acc><m:accPr><m:chr m:val=\"̂\"/></m:accPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:acc></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"−\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:t>k</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>+</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>LoRA</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l−1</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>if </m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t> is a drop layer</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:mr></m:m></m:e></m:d></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_39",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "\\text{FullLayer}l(h{l-1}^{(t)}) & \\text{if } t \\bmod k = 0 \\text{ (refresh step)} \\\\",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_40",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "\\hat{h}l^{(t-k)} + \\text{LoRA}l(h_{l-1}^{(t)}) & \\text{if } l \\text{ is a drop layer}",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_41",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "\\end{cases}",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_42",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_44",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "其中 $\\hat{h}l^{(t-k)}$ 为缓存的上一次完整计算结果，$\\text{LoRA}l$ 为该层的低秩补偿适配器（rank=8）。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_46",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "原版实现（固定缩放）：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_48",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_49",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "hl^{(t)} = \\hat{h}l^{(t-k)} + \\text{LoRA}l(h{l-1}^{(t)})",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>=</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:acc><m:accPr><m:chr m:val=\"̂\"/></m:accPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:acc></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"−\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:t>k</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>+</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>LoRA</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l−1</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_50",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_52",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "LoRA 补偿量直接叠加，无论隐状态漂移程度如何，缩放系数固定为 1。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_54",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "算法改进：方案 A —— 自适应补偿缩放",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_56",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "问题分析： 原版固定缩放假设所有层的漂移幅度相同，但实际上不同层、不同 token 位置的隐状态漂移差异显著。当漂移较小时，过强的 LoRA 补偿会引入噪声；当漂移较大时，固定补偿又可能不足。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_58",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "改进方案： 引入基于隐状态 L2 范数比的自适应缩放因子：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_60",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_61",
    "type": "formula_inline",
    "content": "\\alphal^{(t)} = \\text{clamp}\\left(\\frac{\\|h{l-1}^{(t)} - \\hat{h}{l-1}^{(t-k)}\\|2}{\\|\\hat{h}{l-1}^{(t-k)}\\|2},\\ 0,\\ 2\\right)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>α</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>=</m:t></m:r><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>clamp</m:t></m:r><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\",\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:f><m:fPr><m:type m:val=\"bar\"/></m:fPr><m:num><m:sSub><m:e><m:d><m:dPr><m:begChr m:val=\"‖\"/><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/><m:endChr m:val=\"‖\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l−1</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>−</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:acc><m:accPr><m:chr m:val=\"̂\"/></m:accPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:acc></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l−1</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"−\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:t>k</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup></m:e></m:d></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>2</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:num><m:den><m:sSub><m:e><m:d><m:dPr><m:begChr m:val=\"‖\"/><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/><m:endChr m:val=\"‖\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:acc><m:accPr><m:chr m:val=\"̂\"/></m:accPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:acc></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l−1</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"−\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:t>k</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup></m:e></m:d></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>2</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub></m:den></m:f></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:sty m:val=\"p\"/></m:rPr><m:t> </m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>0</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:sty m:val=\"p\"/></m:rPr><m:t> </m:t></m:r><m:r><m:t>2</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "其中分母加 $\\epsilon=10^{-6}$ 防止除零，缩放上界 2 防止补偿爆炸。",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_62",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_64",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_65",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "hl^{(t)} = \\hat{h}l^{(t-k)} + \\alphal^{(t)} \\cdot \\text{LoRA}l(h_{l-1}^{(t)})",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>=</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:acc><m:accPr><m:chr m:val=\"̂\"/></m:accPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:acc></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"−\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:e><m:r><m:t>k</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>+</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>α</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>·</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:rPr><m:nor/></m:rPr><m:t>LoRA</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>(</m:t></m:r><m:sSubSup><m:e><m:r><m:t>h</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>l−1</m:t></m:r></m:sub><m:sup><m:d><m:dPr><m:sepChr m:val=\"\"/></m:dPr><m:e><m:r><m:t>t</m:t></m:r></m:e></m:d></m:sup></m:sSubSup><m:r><m:t>)</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_66",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "$$",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_68",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "其中分母加 $\\epsilon=10^{-6}$ 防止除零，缩放上界 2 防止补偿爆炸。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_70",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "直觉： 漂移越大，当前 token 与缓存状态差异越大，需要更强的 LoRA 补偿；漂移越小，补偿应趋近于零，退化为直接复用缓存。",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_72",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "代码实现（modelingqwen2lora_drop.py）：",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_74",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "`python",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_75",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "loradelta = self.loraadapter(residualprenorm)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_76",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "if getattr(cfg, \"useadaptivescale\", True):",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_77",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "drift        = (residualprenorm - cached_full).norm(dim=-1, keepdim=True)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>drift=(residua</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>l</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>p</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>renorm−cache</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>d</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>f</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>ull).norm(dim=−1,keepdim=True)</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_78",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "refnorm     = cachedfull.norm(dim=-1, keepdim=True).clamp(min=1e-6)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>re</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>f</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>n</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>orm=cache</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>d</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>f</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>ull.norm(dim=−1,keepdim=True).clamp(min=1e−6)</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_79",
    "type": "formula_block",
    "content": "adaptivescale = (drift / refnorm).clamp(0.0, 2.0)",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    },
    "formula": {
      "text_before": "",
      "omath": "<m:oMath xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\"><m:r><m:t>adaptiv</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>e</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>s</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>cale=(drift/re</m:t></m:r><m:sSub><m:e><m:r><m:t>f</m:t></m:r></m:e><m:sub><m:r><m:t>n</m:t></m:r></m:sub></m:sSub><m:r><m:t>orm).clamp(0.0,2.0)</m:t></m:r></m:oMath>",
      "text_after": "",
      "label": ""
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_80",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "loradelta   = loradelta * adaptive_scale",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_81",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "return cachedfull + loradelta",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "elem_82",
    "type": "body",
    "content": "`",
    "style": {
      "style_name": "Normal",
      "alignment": "left"
